{
    "title": "Little Panda's Town: Princess",
    "description": "Do you dream of immersing yourself in a fantastic princess world? Then come to Little Panda's Town: Princess! Here you'll find a world full of magic and surprises!\r\n\r\nEXQUISITE DRESSES\r\nLet's dress up the princess first! Open the wardrobe and you'll find beautiful dresses and jewelry: elegant evening gowns, cute bubble dresses, delicate crowns, and more! Dress up different styles of outfits to create the most dazzling look for the princess!\r\n\r\nRICH GAMEPLAY\r\nThere are lots of gameplay that will never get you bored: dress-up, cooking, taking care of pets, and more. Here you can learn magic, direct stage plays, prepare a banquet at the palace or explore the Fairytale Forest. You can do whatever you want to do!\r\n\r\nHIDDEN SECRETS\r\nWhether it is a castle or a cottage, there are endless surprises and adventures! How to rescue a frozen prince? Who are the mystery passengers on the magic train? What presents does Santa Clause have in his box? Explore every scene and unveil every secret!\r\n\r\nENDLESS STORIES\r\nHere you can use your imagination to create endless princess stories! Multiple distinctive characters for you to choose: princess, prince, witch, elf and more! Have you decided what kind of story to create?\r\n\r\nA new day has come! What new story will take place in the princess's castle? It's all up to you!\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n- Visit the castle, cottage, theatre, train and more;\r\n- Explore various gameplay: dress-up, cooking, adventures and more;\r\n- Lots of exquisite clothes are added regularly;\r\n- Create your own character freely;\r\n- Lots of featured characters to play with you: princess, prince, elf and more;\r\n- An open princess world without rules!\r\n\r\nAbout BabyBus\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\nAt BabyBus, we dedicate ourselves to sparking kids' creativity, imagination and curiosity,and designing our products through the kids' perspective to help them explore the world on their own.\r\n\r\nNow BabyBus offers a wide variety of products, videos and other educational content for over 600 million fans from ages 0-8 around the world! We have released over 200 children's apps, over 2500 episodes of nursery rhymes and animations, over 9000 stories  of various themes spanning the Health, Language, Society, Science, Art and other fields.\r\n\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\nContact us: ser@babybus.com\r\nVisit us: http://www.babybus.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Do you dream of immersing yourself in a fantastic princess world? Then come to Little Panda&#39;s Town: Princess! Here you&#39;ll find a world full of magic and surprises!<br><br>EXQUISITE DRESSES<br>Let&#39;s dress up the princess first! Open the wardrobe and you&#39;ll find beautiful dresses and jewelry: elegant evening gowns, cute bubble dresses, delicate crowns, and more! Dress up different styles of outfits to create the most dazzling look for the princess!<br><br>RICH GAMEPLAY<br>There are lots of gameplay that will never get you bored: dress-up, cooking, taking care of pets, and more. Here you can learn magic, direct stage plays, prepare a banquet at the palace or explore the Fairytale Forest. You can do whatever you want to do!<br><br>HIDDEN SECRETS<br>Whether it is a castle or a cottage, there are endless surprises and adventures! How to rescue a frozen prince? Who are the mystery passengers on the magic train? What presents does Santa Clause have in his box? Explore every scene and unveil every secret!<br><br>ENDLESS STORIES<br>Here you can use your imagination to create endless princess stories! Multiple distinctive characters for you to choose: princess, prince, witch, elf and more! Have you decided what kind of story to create?<br><br>A new day has come! What new story will take place in the princess&#39;s castle? It&#39;s all up to you!<br><br>FEATURES:<br>- Visit the castle, cottage, theatre, train and more;<br>- Explore various gameplay: dress-up, cooking, adventures and more;<br>- Lots of exquisite clothes are added regularly;<br>- Create your own character freely;<br>- Lots of featured characters to play with you: princess, prince, elf and more;<br>- An open princess world without rules!<br><br>About BabyBus<br>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<br>At BabyBus, we dedicate ourselves to sparking kids&#39; creativity, imagination and curiosity,and designing our products through the kids&#39; perspective to help them explore the world on their own.<br><br>Now BabyBus offers a wide variety of products, videos and other educational content for over 600 million fans from ages 0-8 around the world! We have released over 200 children&#39;s apps, over 2500 episodes of nursery rhymes and animations, over 9000 stories  of various themes spanning the Health, Language, Society, Science, Art and other fields.<br><br>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<br>Contact us: ser@babybus.com<br>Visit us: http://www.babybus.com",
